&lt;p&gt;    I also use the latest master and build zeppelin with this command: &lt;br/&gt;
    ```mvn clean package -Pspark-2.0 -Ppyspark -Psparkr -DskipTests&lt;br/&gt;
    ```, and then export `SPARK_HOME` to where spark-2.0 is located and run pyspark interpreter using `yarn-client` mode.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
